      "side": 1,
      "message": "By the bots, I assume you mean ClusterFuzz? I think we\u0027re not yet using `tint_ir_fuzzer` on ClusterFuzz, so I would say no. I don\u0027t know if we\u0027re using it for the `tint_ast_fuzzer`, but I\u0027m assuming they run the fuzzers as separate processes (maybe with the `-workers \u003cn\u003e` libfuzzer arg).\n\nHaving said that, I think it\u0027s useful to be able to run the fuzzers on separate threads for higher throughput locally. It\u0027s easier to debug a single process, and takes less time to hit a breakpoint.",
